## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-5.2 Codex
- **Short description:** OpenAI’s GPT-5.2 Codex was an agentic coding model optimized for long-horizon coding tasks with native context compaction (now shut down per developer docs).
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI Codex/API surfaces (shut down per docs). Local metadata lists `opencode/gpt-5.2-codex` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Developer docs list knowledge cutoff August 31, 2025. Release announcement not separately reviewed in this pass.
- **IDs:** `gpt-5.2-codex`.
- **Context window:** 400,000 context window; 272,000 maximum input tokens; 128,000 max output tokens (OpenAI developer docs).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (OpenAI developer docs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $1.75 / 1M input tokens, $0.175 / 1M cached input tokens, $14 / 1M output tokens (OpenAI developer docs).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary OpenAI model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

